<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aspărăgus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">asph-</span></b> , <i><span class="en">App.
			Herb. 84</span></i>), i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπάραγος</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσφ-</span>). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Asparagus</i>, <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R.
				6, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">6, 61</span></i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 11,
				3, 45</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 19, 8, 42, § 145</span></i>
			sqq.; 19, 4, 19, § 54; Juv 11, 69; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Aug. 87</span></i> (perh. in Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non.
				p. 550, 11</span></i>, <i>asparagos</i> should be read
			instead of <i>sparagos</i>).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A sprout</i>, <i>a shoot</i>, like
			asparagus, <i><span class="en">Plin. 23, 1, 17, § 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">21, 15, 54, §
			91</span></i>. </div>
